{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33616","headline":"陪友人夏夜对月 · 许棠","name":"陪友人夏夜对月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後伏中宵月，高秋满魄齐。\n轮移仙掌外，影下玉绳西。\n蝉雀飞多悞，星萤出自迷。\n烦蒸惊顿绝，吟翫畏闻鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}